      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "STORM AWAY (7) is the horse to beat after resuming in Saturday company at Ascot, finishing seventh but beaten only three lengths in a 1MW and closing off positively. He now gets an easier assignment and a drop in weight. Fitter for the fresh effort and he can land the knockout blow. FLICK THE SWITCH (2) was third at this track last start when 3.3L away, but did win first-up in this grade. Out to 1230m now, but she draws the inside for Faithfull and she has a strong third-up record. Can put her best foot forward. NICCY'S AFFAIR (8) was beaten as favourite in a NMW last time, but the prior BM58+ win by just over four lengths was eye-catching. Right down in weight now and with her racing pattern, she can give them something to chase. PLAYING RIO (5) resumes off an Albany trial win and can play a leading role on resumption. GIFT OF THE HEART (4) is third-up now and can feature in the finish out to a more suitable distance.",
